","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yaichi is a sixteen-year-old who won the Ryūō title match at a young age. He is the current youngest Ryuuou. Initially, he was overwhelmed by his title and perceived pressure to avoid playing in a \"disgraceful\" manner. He has a calm personality and often doesn't take things seriously unless they are related to shogi. He was taken aback by Ai's talent and determination, and the way she continues to fight and seek a way to victory has helped inspire him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93206"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/267e1ba3432767de5d229278f056791364ebda94bdb6e9b6ef4db0576dbebef2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd2bd9177a00f44f060891ddfa8f03b4e215ac89cb693e500ae9d0b16790699a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"内田 雄馬","creatorId":"vndb:s11606","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11606","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11606","name":"内田雄馬","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85510","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93207","characterName":"空 銀子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93207"},"originalCharacterName":"空 銀子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yaichi's childhood friend and fellow disciple. Ginko is sharp-tongued, brash, and shows no mercy to her opponents in shogi. She is fourteen years old and considered the most talented female player in the shogi history, one of few with enough talent to potentially enter the main shogi league as a full-fledged professional rather than a professional in the women's league."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93207"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/cab3aad2a3f32f85d31d0e5aa2bb686bc740e0ff23259d7513dc1afc96760c17.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e2d5f28dc1d3b25c0e8ecbea67aa32147e450828bea1e066ec97d523f21a765.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金元 寿子","creatorId":"vndb:s1769","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1769","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1769","name":"金元 寿子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85505","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93208","characterName":"雛鶴 あい","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93208"},"originalCharacterName":"雛鶴 あい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yaichi's first disciple, a nine-year-old third grader. She is a cheerful girl with extreme talent for shogi, as well as the daughter of the owners of a large and popular inn which has been the site for major matches in Ishikawa. She holds great admiration for Yaichi for his determination and refusal to give up after witnessing his Ryuuou match."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93208"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/12e2c51bb09d0f493524e35502335c5ac7ddba964ad8e7904d827aeac3180fff.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d206097747491d1bce6381e70aa36bc1d78a322f40c10ef0f60f0beea570ca49.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日高 里菜","creatorId":"vndb:s5611","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5611","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5611","name":"日高 里菜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85508","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93209","characterName":"夜叉神 天衣","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93209"},"originalCharacterName":"夜叉神 天衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"9"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yaichi's second disciple, also nine years old and in the third grade. She has been living with her wealthy grandfather since her parents' deaths. Her father was a skilled amateur shogi player who'd met a younger Yaichi years ago while having an exhibition match against the Meijin. After Yaichi found a path that would have given him a checkmate, Ai's father had suggested that Yaichi someday take his daughter as a disciple, to which he agreed. She was frustrated to see that he does not remember her father, who'd never stopped admiring him, but eventually accepted his request to make her his disciple. She is very proud and prone to display tsundere traits."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93209"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/777fa8c277b0a7e455585